{'symbol': 'CVS', 'date': '2022-03-15 08:42:00', 'title': 'LYFEBULB AND CVS KIDNEY CARE® ANNOUNCE FINALISTS FOR 2022 INNOVATION CHALLENGE IN KIDNEY DISEASE', 'text': 'NEW YORK AND WOONSOCKET, R.I. , MARCH 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LYFEBULB AND CVS KIDNEY CARE®,\xa0A CVS HEALTH®\xa0(NYSE:CVS) COMPANY, ARE PLEASED TO ANNOUNCE 10 FINALISTS FOR THE 2022 INNOVATION CHALLENGE: ACCELERATING INNOVATIONS IN KIDNEY DISEASE TO IMPROVE HEALTH EQUITY AND OUTCOMES.'}